THE TWO CANONICAL PATCHWORKS (skip s of AP{1..13}, patch = multiple of s):
  GW : skip 12 (=n-2), patch 24 =2*(n-2)      -> M=1/14  cover=False  [tight, non-covering]
  CON: skip 13 (=n-1), patch 182=lcm(13,14)   -> M=14/183  cover=True  [covering-min]
  lcm(13,14)=13*14=182; 2*(n-2)=24. Both patches are multiples of the skipped speed.
